.ufl.edu/","source_title":"Reitz Union","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Individual areas, services, events, and reservations may have separate access rules or charges.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uf-marston-science-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Marston Science Library","title":"Marston Science Library","subtitle":"444 Newell Drive","notes":"Choose a collaboration floor for a group session or head to the fourth or fifth floor when you need a designated silent study area.","short_summary":"A science library with reservable rooms, technology lending, and distinct group and silent-study floors.","evidence_claim":"UF Libraries identifies Marston’s first through third floors for group study and its fourth and fifth floors for silent individual study.","source_url":"https://uflib.ufl.edu/using-the-libraries/studyareas/","source_title":"Study & Testing Spaces | UF Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Study-room reservations and library policies apply; check current library access information before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"uf-library-west","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Library West","title":"Library West","subtitle":"1545 West University Avenue","notes":"For focused work, use the fourth-floor quiet area; for collaboration, reserve a group room in advance rather than studying there solo.","short_summary":"The humanities and social-sciences library offers both quiet study and reservable group rooms.","evidence_claim":"Library West lists a fourth-floor quiet-study area and eighteen group study rooms intended for groups of two or more.","source_url":"https://librarywest.uflib.ufl.edu/spaces/","source_titl